                                                "sense_id": "0e7045ce-1653-323d-bc9f-fb22aec07745",
                                                "text": "The society of colonial Spanish-America was one of the most equestrian in all history, and, to a very great extent, its existence depended on the adaptability of the Old World horse to New World conditions."
